  "updated_at": "2026-03-13",
  "bio": "Ana Carolina is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Blumenau, Brazil, renowned for her expertise in trashpolka, dotwork, and floral designs. Her work is characterized by a unique blend of boldness and intricacy, with a touch of graffiti essence that sets her apart. Clients consistently praise the professionalism and cleanliness that Ana Carolina maintains in her studio, ensuring a safe and welcoming environment for every tattoo session.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Blumenau, Santa Catarina, Brazil"
}